{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>香港天文台於今日（11月18日）凌晨12時30分發出特別天氣提示，指出一道冷鋒正逐漸向南移動，預計稍後橫過廣東沿岸，為本港帶來一兩陣雨，並於晚上引致氣溫下降。\n</p>\n<p>未來一兩日天氣將顯著轉涼，市區最低氣溫預測在15至16度，新界地區則可能再低兩至三度。此外，受強烈東北季候風影響，星期五及星期六初時高地將出現較明顯的風寒效應，天氣寒冷。</p>\n<p>天文台提醒市民，特別是進行戶外活動的人士，需密切留意天氣變化，適時添衣保暖，並關心長者及慢性病患者的健康狀況。請提前做好防寒準備，確保安全。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%86%b7%e9%8b%92/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">冷鋒</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a9%e6%96%87%e5%8f%b0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">天文台</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%89%b9%e5%88%a5%e5%a4%a9%e6%b0%a3%e6%8f%90%e7%a4%ba/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">特別天氣提示</a> </p>\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 18 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T16:57:47.144795+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":272,"images":0,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T16:30:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T00:16:12.780350+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T16:51:02.408979+00:00","content_hash":"de1f6760438acb7ef83f26a8486dcb21e2833a4e76ed0fd245689bbefeae9cea","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}